{"slug":"m-n-n","ar":"م ن ن","total":27,"core":"favor; reminding of favors; cutting off","forms":[{"ar":"مَنَّ","kind":"verb","form":1,"count":16,"gloss":"to bestow favor; to remind of favors","word":null,"ex":{"s":74,"a":6,"p":2,"ar":["وَلَا","تَمْنُن","تَسْتَكْثِرُ"],"en":"And do not confer favor to acquire more"}},{"ar":"مَنّ","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":6,"gloss":"favor; reproach; manna","word":null,"ex":{"s":20,"a":80,"p":13,"ar":["يَـٰبَنِىٓ","إِسْرَٰٓءِيلَ","قَدْ","أَنجَيْنَـٰكُم","مِّنْ","عَدُوِّكُمْ","وَوَٰعَدْنَـٰكُمْ","جَانِبَ","ٱلطُّورِ","ٱلْأَيْمَنَ","وَنَزَّلْنَا","عَلَيْكُمُ","ٱلْمَنَّ","وَٱلسَّلْوَىٰ"],"en":"O Children of Israel, We delivered you from your enemy, and We made an appointment with you at the right side of the mount, and We sent down to you manna and quails"}},{"ar":"مَمْنُون","kind":"passive participle","form":null,"count":4,"gloss":"cut off, ending","word":null,"ex":{"s":68,"a":3,"p":5,"ar":["وَإِنَّ","لَكَ","لَأَجْرًا","غَيْرَ","مَمْنُونٍ"],"en":"And indeed, for you is a reward uninterrupted"}},{"ar":"مَنُون","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":1,"gloss":"calamity of time","word":null,"ex":{"s":52,"a":30,"p":7,"ar":["أَمْ","يَقُولُونَ","شَاعِرٌ","نَّتَرَبَّصُ","بِهِۦ","رَيْبَ","ٱلْمَنُونِ"],"en":"Or do they say [of you], \"A poet for whom we await a misfortune of time"}}],"surahs":[[2,3],[49,3],[20,2],[28,2],[52,2],[3,1],[4,1],[6,1],[7,1],[12,1],[14,1],[26,1],[37,1],[38,1],[41,1],[47,1],[68,1],[74,1],[84,1],[95,1]]}